<% content_for :indexable, true %>
<% content_for :container_width, 'max-w-[100rem]' %>
<% content_for :html_title, 'API Reference | Progress Watch' %>
<% content_for :meta_description, 'Complete reference documentation for the Progress Watch API.' %>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-10 lg:flex-row lg:items-start">
  <nav class="shrink-0 lg:sticky lg:top-8 lg:w-64">
    <%= link_to docs_path, class: 'inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-600 transition hover:text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:hover:text-zinc-100' do %>
      <%= svg_icon 'arrow_left', class: 'h-4 w-4' %>
      Docs
    <% end %>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-0.5">
      <% @operations.each do |operation| %>
        <li>
          <a href="#<%= operation[:id] %>" class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-lg px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-zinc-600 transition hover:bg-zinc-100 hover:text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-300 dark:hover:bg-zinc-600 dark:hover:text-zinc-100">
            <%= render 'method', method: operation[:method], class: 'w-12' %>
            <span><%= operation[:summary] %></span>
          </a>
        </li>
      <% end %>
    </ul>
  </nav>
  <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-x-10 gap-y-6 xl:flex-row">
      <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">API Reference</h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">Seven operations, and nothing to authenticate with — the space UUID in the path is the credential. For commands to paste rather than shapes to build against, see <%= link_to 'curl', docs_section_path('curl'), class: 'text-brand-600 underline dark:text-brand-400' %>. The same surface is published as OpenAPI 3.1 at <%= link_to '/openapi.json', openapi_path, class: 'text-brand-600 underline dark:text-brand-400' %>, if you would rather generate a client than write one.</p>
        <h2 class="mt-8 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Four things to know before you build on this</h2>
        <ol class="mt-3 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-1 2xl:grid-cols-2">
          <li class="card flex gap-3 p-4">
            <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-zinc-100 font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-500 dark:bg-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">1</span>
            <div class="min-w-0">
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">A write replaces the whole state</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">Omitting <code class="font-mono text-xs">values</code> clears it rather than leaving it alone, and <code class="font-mono text-xs">PATCH</code> is refused with a 405 rather than quietly promising a merge. The one exception is a body of just <code class="font-mono text-xs">{"done": true}</code>, which closes the task and keeps the last numbers.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="card flex gap-3 p-4">
            <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-zinc-100 font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-500 dark:bg-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">2</span>
            <div class="min-w-0">
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100"><code class="font-mono text-xs">progress: null</code> is not zero</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">It means nothing has been reported, or what was reported has expired. A task at zero reports an object with <code class="font-mono text-xs">current: 0</code>.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="card flex gap-3 p-4">
            <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-zinc-100 font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-500 dark:bg-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">3</span>
            <div class="min-w-0">
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">A parent's progress is derived</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">With children, its own counts are ignored and <code class="font-mono text-xs">aggregated</code> is true. Never report against a parent.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="card flex gap-3 p-4">
            <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-zinc-100 font-mono text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-500 dark:bg-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">4</span>
            <div class="min-w-0">
              <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">Completion is one-way</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">It fires the notification once. Reporting afterwards still overwrites progress, but nothing completes twice.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full min-w-0 xl:max-w-md">
        <h2 class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">One task, start to finish</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300">Every operation below, in the order you would call them. Read the loop and you have the model: a write carries the counts it knows, <code class="font-mono text-xs">end</code> may change between calls, and closing takes nothing but <code class="font-mono text-xs">done</code>.</p>
        <div class="mt-3">
          <%= render 'samples', samples: OpenApi::CodeSamples.lifecycle(base_url: request.base_url) %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <% @operations.each do |operation| %>
      <section id="<%= operation[:id] %>" class="mt-10 border-t border-zinc-200 pt-10 dark:border-zinc-600">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-x-10 gap-y-6 xl:flex-row">
          <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl"><%= operation[:summary] %></h2>
            <p class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
              <%= render 'method', method: operation[:method] %>
              <span class="break-all font-mono text-sm text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100"><%= operation[:path] %></span>
            </p>
            <% if operation[:description].present? %>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300"><%= operation[:description] %></p>
            <% end %>
            <% if operation[:parameters].any? %>
              <h3 class="mt-6 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Path parameters</h3>
              <dl class="mt-3 divide-y divide-zinc-200 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 dark:divide-zinc-600 dark:border-zinc-600">
                <% operation[:parameters].each do |parameter| %>
                  <div class="px-3 py-2.5">
                    <dt class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2">
                      <span class="font-mono text-xs font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100"><%= parameter['name'] %></span>
                      <span class="font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400"><%= OpenApi::Operations.type_label(parameter['schema']) %></span>
                      <% if parameter['required'] %>
                        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400">required</span>
                      <% end %>
                    </dt>
                    <% if parameter['description'].present? %>
                      <dd class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300"><%= parameter['description'] %></dd>
                    <% end %>
                  </div>
                <% end %>
              </dl>
            <% end %>
            <% if operation[:request_body] %>
              <h3 class="mt-6 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Request body</h3>
              <%= render 'schema', schema: operation[:request_body], request: true %>
            <% end %>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full min-w-0 xl:max-w-md">
            <% samples = OpenApi::CodeSamples.call(operation, base_url: request.base_url) %>
            <% if samples.any? %>
              <h3 class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Example</h3>
              <div class="mt-3 mb-6">
                <%= render 'samples', samples: %>
              </div>
            <% end %>
            <h3 class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">Responses</h3>
            <% operation[:responses].each do |response| %>
              <div class="mt-3">
                <p class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2">
                  <span class="rounded px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs font-semibold <%= response[:status].start_with?('2') ? 'bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 dark:bg-emerald-900/40 dark:text-emerald-300' : 'bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 dark:bg-amber-900/40 dark:text-amber-300' %>"><%= response[:status] %></span>
                  <span class="text-xs text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-300"><%= response[:description] %></span>
                </p>
                <% if response[:schema] %>
                  <%= render 'schema', schema: response[:schema], request: false %>
                <% end %>
              </div>
            <% end %>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
